href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use><use data-c=\"4C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4C\" transform=\"translate(833,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>So the volume of water needed is 9000 mL or 9,000 mL (nearest integer).</p>\n"
